// Heads-ups only. Not tasks I took on. Ethos: document what IS.
- docs/index.html loads ../js/dynamichead.js, which resolves to tesseract_city/js/.
  That folder does not exist; ../../js/dynamichead.js is the path that resolves.
- api_sdk_lmnop.html is linked from the docs nav ("Reference" section).
- Two names in _TERMINUS.__all__ are currently unbound at runtime:
  comtrya, get_morning_ritual_status.
- Publishing this module: commit + push it in __marinus__/01_Docs (repo
  gewey/tesseract-docs), then in gewey.github.io run
  `git submodule update --remote tesseract_city/docs` and commit the new pointer.
  The site only serves the commit the parent repo points at.
